===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[yellow]] [[bile]]|-}}

# One of the four [[humour]]s of ancient and mediaeval [[physiology]], that was believed to be secreted by the [[liver]] and to cause irascibility, anger, and bad temper when present in excess.

